## New Card Checklist

1. `elementCards.ts` → 2. `elementClassPools.ts` → 3. `elementAbilities.ts` → 4. UI wiring if needed → 5. `__effects_check.ts` → 6. playtest script / `npm run test:effects`

**Do not change cooldown formulas unless explicitly requested.**

## Stack (Today)

React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Zustand, R3F/Three.js, `motion`, Tailwind, `tsx` sims. WebGPU / Wasm / GSAP / Rapier are aspirational — adopt only when justified.
